{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "cues": [
    {
      "id": "two-goals-cue-1",
      "transcript": "Barbados scored an own goal on purpose. Then they defended both goals.",
      "file": "audio/two-goals/narration/cue-1.wav",
      "start": 0,
      "duration": 4.875,
      "beatIndex": 0,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "two-goals.asset.qualification.script.1",
      "samples": 117000,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "two-goals-cue-2",
      "transcript": "It was a Caribbean Cup qualifier in 1994. And winning the match wasn't enough.",
      "file": "audio/two-goals/narration/cue-2.wav",
      "start": 5.266666666666667,
      "duration": 5.775,
      "beatIndex": 1,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "two-goals.asset.qualification.script.2",
      "samples": 138600,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "two-goals-cue-3",
      "transcript": "Barbados needed to win by two goals to qualify. Late in the game, they led two-one. A win—but still elimination.",
      "file": "audio/two-goals/narration/cue-3.wav",
      "start": 11.266666666666667,
      "duration": 8.225,
      "beatIndex": 2,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "two-goals.asset.qualification.script.3",
      "samples": 197400,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "two-goals-cue-4",
      "transcript": "They could try to score again. Or exploit an unusual rule.",
      "file": "audio/two-goals/narration/cue-4.wav",
      "start": 19.7,
      "duration": 4,
      "beatIndex": 3,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "two-goals.asset.qualification.script.4",
      "samples": 96000,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "two-goals-cue-5",
      "transcript": "A draw at full time meant extra time. The first goal there would end the match—and count double.",
      "file": "audio/two-goals/narration/cue-5.wav",
      "start": 23.9,
      "duration": 6.15,
      "beatIndex": 4,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "two-goals.asset.qualification.script.5",
      "samples": 147600,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "two-goals-cue-6",
      "transcript": "So, one goal in extra time could give Barbados the two-goal margin they needed.",
      "file": "audio/two-goals/narration/cue-6.wav",
      "start": 30.266666666666666,
      "duration": 5.7,
      "beatIndex": 5,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "two-goals.asset.qualification.script.6",
      "samples": 136800,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "two-goals-cue-7",
      "transcript": "They deliberately scored into their own net. Two-two. Now they just needed to keep it tied.",
      "file": "audio/two-goals/narration/cue-7.wav",
      "start": 36.166666666666664,
      "duration": 5.8,
      "beatIndex": 6,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "two-goals.asset.qualification.script.7",
      "samples": 139200,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "two-goals-cue-8",
      "transcript": "But Grenada had spotted a way to stop them.",
      "file": "audio/two-goals/narration/cue-8.wav",
      "start": 42.333333333333336,
      "duration": 3.025,
      "beatIndex": 7,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "two-goals.asset.qualification.script.8",
      "samples": 72600,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "two-goals-cue-9",
      "transcript": "Score against Barbados, and Grenada wins. Score into their own goal, and Grenada loses by only one—still enough to qualify.",
      "file": "audio/two-goals/narration/cue-9.wav",
      "start": 45.56666666666667,
      "duration": 8.9,
      "beatIndex": 8,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "two-goals.asset.qualification.script.9",
      "samples": 213600,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "two-goals-cue-10",
      "transcript": "Before full time, either goal would do.",
      "file": "audio/two-goals/narration/cue-10.wav",
      "start": 54.666666666666664,
      "duration": 2.825,
      "beatIndex": 9,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "two-goals.asset.qualification.script.10",
      "samples": 67800,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "two-goals-cue-11",
      "transcript": "Barbados had to protect their own goal—and Grenada's. The opponent's net had become something they needed to defend.",
      "file": "audio/two-goals/narration/cue-11.wav",
      "start": 57.86666666666667,
      "duration": 7.55,
      "beatIndex": 10,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "two-goals.asset.qualification.script.11",
      "samples": 181200,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "two-goals-cue-12",
      "transcript": "They kept it two-two until full time.",
      "file": "audio/two-goals/narration/cue-12.wav",
      "start": 65.63333333333334,
      "duration": 2.825,
      "beatIndex": 11,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "two-goals.asset.qualification.script.12",
      "samples": 67800,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "two-goals-cue-13",
      "transcript": "Then Barbados scored the extra-time winner. It counted as a two-goal victory. They qualified.",
      "file": "audio/two-goals/narration/cue-13.wav",
      "start": 68.66666666666667,
      "duration": 6.425,
      "beatIndex": 12,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "two-goals.asset.qualification.script.13",
      "samples": 154200,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "two-goals-cue-14",
      "transcript": "Scoring against themselves hadn't been the mistake. It was their way of making the rules work for them.",
      "file": "audio/two-goals/narration/cue-14.wav",
      "start": 75.3,
      "duration": 6.25,
      "beatIndex": 13,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "two-goals.asset.qualification.script.14",
      "samples": 150000,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    }
  ],
